<body>
<sync start=1030><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>易考范文二十四</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　In the interesting drawing,</font>
<sync start=3440><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>易考范文二十四</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　In the interesting drawing,</font>
<sync start=7270><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>a beautifully-dressed woman is standing there,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　a piece of red cloth covering her face.</font>
<sync start=10000><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>a beautifully-dressed woman is standing there,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　a piece of red cloth covering her face.</font>
<sync start=13720><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>However, when a man lifts the cloth, he is shocked to see an ugly face.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　A word—advertisement—stands out on the cloth.</font>
<sync start=18970><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>However, when a man lifts the cloth, he is shocked to see an ugly face.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　A word—advertisement—stands out on the cloth.</font>
<sync start=22690><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Obviously, the purpose of the drawing is to appeal to the public</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　for more concern about false advertising.</font>
<sync start=26950><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Obviously, the purpose of the drawing is to appeal to the public</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　for more concern about false advertising.</font>
<sync start=29800><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Now, we live in a world of advertisements,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　which appear on mass media such as TV, radio, newspaper and magazine.</font>
<sync start=33190><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Now, we live in a world of advertisements,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　which appear on mass media such as TV, radio, newspaper and magazine.</font>
<sync start=38770><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Usually, advertisers make a point of fine pictures, melodious music or charming stars,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　which, in some cases, are merely a deceitful veil on fake merchandize.</font>
<sync start=46310><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Usually, advertisers make a point of fine pictures, melodious music or charming stars,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　which, in some cases, are merely a deceitful veil on fake merchandize.</font>
<sync start=51340><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Moreover, some advertisers boast about the effectiveness of the products,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　but consumers sometimes are disappointed to find the products are not so good.</font>
<sync start=57140><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Moreover, some advertisers boast about the effectiveness of the products,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　but consumers sometimes are disappointed to find the products are not so good.</font>
<sync start=63050><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>To solve the problem, my suggestions are as follows.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　First, it is essential for consumers to use their reason to discern the authenticity of the ads.</font>
<sync start=67310><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>To solve the problem, my suggestions are as follows.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　First, it is essential for consumers to use their reason to discern the authenticity of the ads.</font>
<sync start=74970><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>In addition, advertisers should increase their awareness of public responsibility</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　to ensure the truthfulness of the ads they design.</font>
<sync start=80660><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>In addition, advertisers should increase their awareness of public responsibility</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　to ensure the truthfulness of the ads they design.</font>
<sync start=84050><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>At the same time, the media must ban ads as soon as they are found to be misleading and exaggerating.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Of course, we cannot solely rely on the morality of advertisers and the media,</font>
<sync start=91160><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>At the same time, the media must ban ads as soon as they are found to be misleading and exaggerating.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Of course, we cannot solely rely on the morality of advertisers and the media,</font>
<sync start=96510><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>because stronger supervision,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　stricter laws and regulations play a more important role in eliminating deceptive advertisements.</font>
<sync start=98380><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>because stronger supervision,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　stricter laws and regulations play a more important role in eliminating deceptive advertisements.</font>
